			<div class="content" id="post-content-3824482">
									

<p>Thanks to djkaktus for being a mensch, and to stormbreath for the crit!</p>
<p>Image rights: Mine and free for anyone to do whatever. Picture is of aluminum laboratory specimen containers, written on in low-effort style with a wet-erase sharpie.</p>
<p>&lt;DrConnors&gt;: I need a volunteer<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: I need one SCPper who is willing to be a victim of a horrible fate<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: Just your screenname, really, in a skip I'm writing<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: wait, an in-universe character?<br />
&lt;Bennings&gt;: The most satisfying parts of worldbuilding are when you solve two problems at once<br />
&lt;multizig&gt;: DrConnors: I volunteer as tribute<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: DrConnors: I voluntee- DAMMIT<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: THIS CONTACT IS SEALED<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: ;-;<br />
MaliceAF slinks back into the shadows<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: I might be able to squeeze two of ya'll in there<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: on the other hand, I do have a habit of killing off my own characters before anyone else can<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: Just sign in blood on the dotted line, please<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: whose blood?<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: Doesn't matter<br />
MaliceAF raises knife, giggles quietly<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: hehehehehe<br />
&lt;multizig&gt;: O-O<br />
&lt;multizig&gt;: noplsibegyounottodothis<br />
MaliceAF slashes wildly, misses everyone, cuts his cheek, falls face-first onto the contract and accidentally signs it<br />
&lt;MaliceAF&gt;: whoopsie<br />
&lt;DrConnors&gt;: Away to my writing hole.</p>
<p>Edit: let the hatred for dado flow through you</p>

